      "writtenOn": "2026-08-19T05:36:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Expanding the search root from .../chassis/motherboard to .../inventory/system is required for multi-chassis support. Have we evaluated whether this could significantly increase the number of inventory objects returned on larger systems and impact lookup time?",
      "revId": "3a5176f69a0f3a1042569b073e8db5b14bf372c4",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
